    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_027H8ro843qD4ThD",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_bcogOozTP9tyXFbA",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Lio is the flavored air diffuser that makes quitting <strong>simple and enjoyable</strong>. Relief cravings and keep your hand-to-mouth habit—<strong>anytime, anywhere—without nicotine, vapor, or smoke.</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_NhEzeiyKQcEb9Py5",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>SHIPPING &amp; DELIVERY</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_3qmbj9D625a4UYfo",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Shipping within the UAE takes 1 to 2 business days, and all orders over €39 qualify for free shipping. </strong></h3><h3></h3><h3>For deliveries outside the UAE but within the Middle East, shipping times are 2 to 3 business days. </h3><h3></h3><h3>Your order will be processed within 5 hours and shipped from our fulfillment center in the UAE.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_lzphUA0dycUB2YUK",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>IS LIO® HALAL?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_jNeQLkVvKvBDWCsI",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Lio® is free from nicotine, chemicals, and harmful substances, making it a natural, non-electric option. Since it contains no intoxicants or prohibited ingredients, <strong>Lio® aligns with Halal practices</strong>. However, always consult with a religious authority if you have concerns.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_SLQN5birnugdFHn7",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>WHAT&apos;S IN A STARTERPACK?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_VpdGvOIZx2KZ3amK",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>LIO® GEN 2 STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Gen 2 – made from stainless steel 1x Lio® Cleaning Kit – to keep your Lio® Gen 2 spotless 1x Lio® Leather Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to monitor your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>LIO® CLASSIC STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Classic – crafted from olive or walnut wood 1x Lio® Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to track your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3>Finally, choose 3, 6, or 9 bags of your favorite flavor Cores. Each bag contains 3 Cores, with each Core lasting 10 days. Three bags give you a full month of refreshing air!</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_l9OP7H9ccio6Ktcc",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>ARE THE INGREDIENTS IN THE FLAVOUR CORES NATURAL?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_7cdBRjEsKdHYVYOh",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>You bet! Lio is powered by nature—<strong>no nicotine, smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals</strong>, just pure goodness. Each Core is medical-grade &amp; soaked in a special blend of pure <strong>essential oils</strong>, sourced from farms across the globe. Think of it as a breath of fresh air, straight from nature’s finest!</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_KS3OHkCBQ2WaRiWm",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>THE SAFEFY AND SCIENCE</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_CWW56iO1X0fShD0k",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Safety first, always</strong>! Every natural plant compound in our products goes through serious third-party testing. These tests (plus a bunch of studies) prove that what you&apos;re inhaling is <strong>safe and effective</strong>. We&apos;re all about research to make sure you get a reliable, natural, non-electric option that keeps you healthy without skimping on safety or results.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_7FoL1Mj6Vx0gbzLD",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>WHAT IS LIO®?</p>"
    },
